# Data attributions

## Airport reference data

`data/airports.json` is derived from **OurAirports**:

- Source: https://davidmegginson.github.io/ourairports-data/airports.csv
- Project: https://ourairports.com/data/
- License: public domain (as stated by the OurAirports data page)

Only IATA code, airport name, municipality, and ISO country are retained.

## Airline reference data

`data/airlines.json` is derived from **OpenFlights**:

- Source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jpatokal/openflights/master/data/airlines.dat
- Project: https://openflights.org/data.html
- License: Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0 —
  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Only active ICAO designator and airline name are retained. The derived airline
lookup table is made available under the same ODbL terms.

## Flight data

Flight data is fetched at runtime from the Hong Kong International Airport public
flight-information service. It is not bundled with this project.

## Airport access data

Airport Express train times are fetched at runtime from the **MTR Next Train**
API published through data.gov.hk:

- Endpoint: https://rt.data.gov.hk/v1/transport/mtr/getSchedule.php
- Dataset: https://data.gov.hk/en-data/dataset/mtr-data2-nexttrain-data
- Provider: MTR Corporation Limited

The following reference facts are bundled as dated snapshots, checked on
**2026-11-22**. They are factual timetable/fare/service information, not a copy
of a database, and remain subject to the providers' terms:

- Airport Express journey times, first/last trains, frequency and fares:
  https://www.mtr.com.hk/en/customer/services/timetable_index.html,
  https://www.mtr.com.hk/en/customer/services/train_service_index.html and
  https://www.mtr.com.hk/en/customer/tickets/tf_index.html
- In-town check-in participating airlines, station hours and conditions:
  https://www.mtr.com.hk/en/customer/services/complom_checkin.html
- Airport A-route bus destinations, fares, operators and airport departure
  windows: https://www.hongkongairport.com/en/transport/to-from-airport/public-buses.page

MTR and HKIA are not affiliated with this project and do not endorse it. Verify
hours, fares and availability with the provider before travel.
